From: Ivan S. Titov <iohann.s.titov@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 00:45:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] tests: register the suite with CTest

tests/CMakeLists.txt includes CTest and Catch, but enable_testing() is
not called at the top level, so ctest run from the build root finds no
tests.
---
--- a/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -151,6 +151,7 @@
 
 add_subdirectory(source)
 if (BUILD_TESTS)
+	enable_testing()
 	add_subdirectory(tests)
 endif()
 if (BUILD_EXECUTABLES)
